DESCRIPTION:Join us for extended hours at the Ackland Art Museum during the
  Carrboro-Chapel Hill 2nd Friday ArtWalk! Each month\, we stay open from 5
 :00 – 9:00 p.m. to give visitors more time to explore. \nAt 6 p.m.\, tak
 e a tour of the new exhibition Continental Shift: Recent Acquisitions of A
 frican Art with curator Peter Nisbet. Free\, but space is limited\; click 
 here to register for your free ticket. \nStroll through our galleries feat
 uring highlights from a collection of over 21\,000 works of art. Sketch in
  the galleries using free art supplies from our lobby’s art cart. \nAdmi
 ssion to the Ackland is always free\; no prior registration needed. Whethe
 r you’re stopping by solo or bringing friends\, come be inspired during 
 our extended open hours!
GEO:35.912593;-79.054867
