DESCRIPTION:Looking for an exciting array of office hours specialists in on
 e place?\n\n \n\nMentor Morning is a casual\, high-impact networking exper
 ience designed to connect entrepreneurs\, students\, and community members
  with experienced mentors in an approachable and flexible format. During t
 he event\, multiple mentors will be available at individual tables while a
 ttendees rotate through the space to ask questions\, seek advice\, explore
  ideas\, and build connections. Rather than scheduling formal one-on-one m
 eetings\, participants can engage in shorter\, organic conversations with 
 several mentors in a single visit. Hosted at The Innovate Carolina Junctio
 n in collaboration with Launch Chapel Hill\, this month's Mentor Morning w
 ill feature mentors engaging with members of the Launch Chapel Hill studen
 t cohort as well as international student ventures participating in an inn
 ovation hub crawl. Community entrepreneurs\, coworking members\, and other
  attendees are also encouraged to participate.
