DTSTART:20260821T160000Z
DTEND:20260821T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:In difficult economic times\, many people are struggling to jus
 t keep up with monthly bills\, let alone make progress on debt repayment. 
 What suffers most is contributing to savings and investing goals. This ses
 sion will focus on developing financial plans and strategies to address th
 e dual goals of having a plan for paying off debt\, while also contributin
 g to building personal wealth. This session covers the basics (or essentia
 ls) of each area and describes practical techniques that can help you to f
 ormulate your own plan to manage your personal finances to organize a sens
 ible debt repayment plan without sacrificing other financial goals.\n\n \n
 \nClick on Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Request” 
 button to automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Paying off Debt While Building Wealth
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/paying-off-debt-while-building
 -wealth-3947
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
