DTSTAMP:20260731T040457Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53558061633860
DTSTART:20260825T130000Z
DTEND:20260825T143000Z
DESCRIPTION:Forward Deployed Engineering (FDE) has rapidly become the hotte
 st job in the AI revolution\, and a new breed\, the AI-Augmented FDE\, is 
 redefining who gets to participate in the future of technology. AI-Augment
 ed FDEs sit at the intersection of customer impact\, rapid prototyping\, a
 nd applied AI\; they're the people who turn messy\, real-world problems in
 to working solutions at high speed\, using AI as their build partner.\n\n 
 \n\nThis high-energy\, hands-on 90-minute workshop proves that you don't n
 eed deep AI expertise or traditional tech credentials to break into this f
 ield. In an era where AI handles the heavy lifting\, human skills\, curios
 ity\, empathy\, problem-solving\, communication\, are the real advantage.\
 n\nParticipants will step directly into the role of an AI-Augmented FDE: u
 ncover a real customer problem\, build a working prototype using accessibl
 e AI-powered tools\, and iterate based on live feedback. By the end\, you'
 ll understand the AI-Augmented FDE mindset\, experience the thrill of rapi
 d delivery\, and walk away with a clear\, confidence-building path into on
 e of the most in-demand roles in the AI industry.
GEO:35.914361;-79.054904
LOCATION:Innovate Carolina Junction\, 050/051
SUMMARY:Become an AI Augmented Forward Deployed Engineer
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/become-an-ai-augmented-forward
 -deployed-engineer
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
