DESCRIPTION:Looking for an internship\, a job\, graduate school\, or explor
 ing career paths? \n\n \n\nJoin us at the Fall Jobs & Internships Career F
 air 2026 — where Tar Heels can meet and network with top employers and s
 chools from a wide range of fields\, including (but not limited to) arts\,
  business\, education\, healthcare\, nonprofits\, technology\, and more. A
 ll undergraduates and graduate students are welcome! \n\n \n\nDay 1: Septe
 mber 16 from 10am-3pm\nDay 2: September 17 from 10am-3pm
