DESCRIPTION:This course will cover topics beyond the scope of the Introduct
 ory to Qualtrics short course. We will take a deeper dive into Survey Flow
  features including embedded data\, customizing the End of Survey experien
 ce\, Screen Out Management\, and implementing randomization. We will explo
 re methods of importing embedded data into your survey\, sending informati
 on from one survey to another\, and setting embedded data in your survey t
 hrough conditions within your survey. An introduction to automations will 
 be illustrated through an example use case that sends respondents to a dra
 wing survey after completing their survey. Finally\, we will create custom
  reports to share with others in the ‘reports’ tab. Course material wi
 ll be incorporated into a shared Group in which all participants will be a
 dded\, offering hands-on practice with shared Libraries\, and Directories.
  Additional features to be discussed include piping\, authentication\, and
  version management.\n\nRegistration and fee are required for Zoom link ac
 cess.
